station","node":"work_complete","runs":[{"role":"narration","who":null,"text":"The applause lasts exactly six seconds. Not five and three quarters. Not six and a bit. Six. The green lamp above your console lights up: ACCEPTED."}]},{"n":1,"src":"text","mode":"narrative","chapter":"prologue-00","scene":"workplace/applause_station","node":"work_complete","runs":[]},{"n":1,"src":"text","mode":"narrative","chapter":"prologue-00","scene":"workplace/applause_station","node":"work_complete","runs":[{"role":"narration","who":null,"text":"Another flawless assignment. You file the timing sheet, leave your desk, and head for the restroom."}]},{"n":2,"src":"text","mode":"dialogue","chapter":"prologue-00","scene":"workplace/corridor","node":"drone_intercepts","runs":[{"role":"direction","who":null,"text":"A bright chime rings out. A small, round drone floats into your path and makes a gentle correction to its height."},{"role":"speech","who":"termination_drone","text":"Good morning! Your final assignment has been approved. Congratulations!"},{"role":"speech","who":"termination_drone","text":"Your position has also been discontinued, along with 499,999 others. I am sorry if the timing is inconvenient. I have selected my most comforting volume."}]},{"n":3,"src":"echo","mode":"dialogue","chapter":"prologue-00","scene":"workplace/corridor","node":"drone_intercepts","runs":[{"role":"speech","who":"you","text":"I WAS JUST GOING TO THE BATHROOM."}]},{"n":3,"src":"text","mode":"dialogue","chapter":"prologue-00","scene":"workplace/corridor","node":"drone_presents_notice","runs":[{"role":"direction","who":null,"text":"A narrow pink document appears from the slot below the speaker grille. Three carbon copies are joined at the top. A tiny pencil hangs from a chain."},{"role":"speech","who":"termination_drone","text":"Please acknowledge that you have received notice. Signing does not mean that you agree with it. You are no longer required to agree with anything here."}]},{"n":4,"src":"echo","mode":"dialogue","chapter":"prologue-00","scene":"workplace/corridor","node":"drone_presents_notice","runs":[{"role":"action","who":"you","text":"SIGN THE NOTICE AND TAKE YOUR COPY."}]},{"n":4,"src":"text","mode":"dialogue","chapter":"prologue-00","scene":"workplace/corridor","node":"signed_response","runs":[{"role":"direction","who":null,"text":"The chained pencil barely reaches the signature box. You lift the paper to meet it. The drone draws back two copies and leaves the smudged bottom sheet for you."},{"role":"speech","who":"termination_drone","text":"Thank you. Your cooperation will be credited to your former department. I understand it has also been discontinued."}]}],"presentFrom":6,"steps":4,"taken":[{"n":2,"at":"prologue-00:work_complete","c":"head_to_restroom"},{"n":3,"at":"prologue-00:drone_intercepts","c":"drone_show_form"},{"n":4,"at":"prologue-00:drone_presents_notice","c":"sign_notice"}],"contextDone":[],"checks":{},"seed":"1"},"cursor":{"presented":8}}
